Advanced Program in Animation & Visual Effects

The Advanced Program in Animation and Visual Effects is a career-focused course designed to build complete animation and VFX professionals. Covering creative design, 3D production, and advanced FX compositing, the program guides learners through the full production pipeline — from visual storytelling and motion graphics to asset creation, character animation, procedural effects, and final compositing. Students develop practical skills through hands-on projects and demo reels. By completion, learners can independently produce animated and VFX content, preparing them for studio roles, post-production careers, and freelance opportunities.

